<title>JAPAN: Dynic rises in early morning trade.</title>
<headline>Dynic rises in early morning trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynic Corp rose in early morning trade on Monday as the approach of the margin trade settlement date was making it easier to buy the shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0050 GMT, the share was up 48 yen at 708 yen, making it the second largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 582,000 shares. Dynic is Japan's largest maker of bookbinding cloths.</p>
</text>
